- [ ] `cargo fmt --check`, clippy `-D warnings`, `spec check` and `classify --claims` are green.
- [ ] The harness checks all pass: rustfmt, catalog, patches, rulings, clippy, cargo tests, web tests. `git status` shows only `acceptance.rs` changed.
- [ ] No `#[allow]`, `#[ignore]` or lowered check anywhere.

